{"title":"1202.3737 Detecting low-complexity unobserved causes","markdown":{"headingText":"1202.3737 Detecting low-complexity unobserved causes","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Dominik Janzing, Eleni Sgouritsa, Oliver Stegle, Jonas Peters, Bernhard Schölkopf（MPI），2012-02-14，arXiv:1202.3737\n- **一句话定位**：利用条件分布 P(Y|x) 在分布单纯形（simplex）中的几何位置（\"纯性\"）与线性张成维数，判断两变量 X、Y 的依赖是源于直接因果边 X→Y，还是所有因果路径上都存在一个低复杂度（如二元）隐变量 Z。\n- **研究问题**：统计遗传学动机——某 SNP 与表型相关时，判断该 SNP 本身是因果的，还是仅与某个隐因果 SNP 连锁（X↔Z→Y 或 X←Z→Y）；仅凭 P(X,Y) 区分\"直接因果\"与\"路径上含低值域（low range）隐变量\"。\n- **模型与方法**：核心定义 1（纯条件分布，pure conditionals）：P(Y|X) 称 k-wise pure，若任意 k 个不同 x 对应的 P(Y|x) 的任何含负系数的仿射组合都不是合法分布（会越出单纯形边界）。引理 1 给出判据：pairwise pure ⟺ 对每对 (x1,x2)，inf_y p(y|x1)/p(y|x2)=0；引理 2：有限值域 Y 时纯性 ⟺ 支撑集互不包含。假设 1：自然界的因果机制（尤其加性噪声模型）多产生纯条件分布，纯性是直接因果边的证据；假设 2：{P(Y|x)} 的线性相关非一般（generic），需要低维隐变量的因果解释。实用检验：高斯核密度估计 P̂(Y|x)，在观测值区间等距格点上计算 purity ratio = max_{(x,x')} min_y p̂(y|x)/p̂(y|x')；维数估计用核嵌入（RKHS embedding）的条件分布 Gram 矩阵的秩。\n- **主要命题/定理**：引理 4：ANM（加性噪声模型）Y=f(X)+E，f 单射且 d log p(e)/de→±∞（如高斯噪声）时 pairwise pure，ψ′ 有界则不纯；引理 5：等方差高斯条件分布 pure，一般高斯 one-sided pure；引理 6：纯性在 Y 的连续双射（后非线性 g）下不变；引理 7：同幂律尾部（fat-tailed）导致不纯；引理 8（级联）：若 X⊥⊥Y|Z，则 P(Y|X) 为 k-wise pure 蕴含 P(Z|X) 也 k-wise pure；定理 1：P(Y|X) pairwise pure 时不存在值域满足 m(|Z|)<|X| 的 Z 使 X⊥⊥Y|Z（故 X 为多个二元变量时无二元隐变量可解释）；定理 2：pairwise pure 排除紧值域、条件密度连续正的 Z；定理 3：若二元 Z 使 X⊥⊥Y|Z 且 P(Y|Z) pairwise pure，则 P(X,Z,Y) 由 P(X,Y) 确定（至多翻转 Z），即隐二元原因可重构；引理 10/推论 2：D(P(Y|X))≤min{D(P(Y|Z)),D(P(Z|X))}，故 X⊥⊥Y|Z 蕴含凸维数 D^c≤|Z|。实验：合成数据（各 1000 次模拟）显示 X→Y 情形 purity ratio 多小于 0.1，X←Z→Y 情形显著偏大；拟真实数据基于拟南芥（Arabidopsis）250K SNP 芯片、1200 样本的实测 SNP 联合分布加模拟表型，各生成 1000 对因果/非因果 SNP-表型对，在中等损坏水平（corruption level）下 purity 的 ROC-AUC 一致高于相关系数 r²，强相关非因果 SNP 不产生纯性假阳性。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：属于\"仅凭观察分布的函数/几何性质做隐混杂检测\"这一支线（与 Janzing et al. 2009 用 ANM 检测隐混杂、LiNGAM 隐因子版相呼应），把因果推断与分布几何、RKHS 嵌入结合；是 Schölkopf 团队将两变量因果方法扩展到\"检测低复杂度隐公共原因\"的代表性尝试。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1202.3737.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式"